Rule 2 (per-axis min/max is only required for non-empty axes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : if shape(v_1, i) > 0 then min(v_1, i) ≤ max(v_1, i)
