Rule 3 (global min/max is only required for non-empty tensors)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 then min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
>>
Rule 4 (dtype of the input tensor is well-defined)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_1)
>>
Rule 5 (any iterated axis index is within valid bounds)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : 0 ≤ i ∧ i ≤ ndim(v_1) - 1
